<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Roome Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Roome Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">Roome</para>
  <para style="toc2">Roome</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Roome Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaariya Phawuloosa kiitay Roome asaas xaafetiday, Phawuloosi Roomen de7iya woosa keetha be7anaw qopida gisho, I biya wode enti giigidi naagana mela oothanaasa. Phawuloosa qofay Roomen de7iya ammaneysatara guutha wode oothidaape guye, enti iya maaddin Ispeene baanaasa. Roome kiitan ammanoba I eridaysa, ammaniya asay he timirtiya ooson peeshana mela qoncisidi xaafis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Roomen de7iya ammaniya asaa koyro sarothi simmidi, kaallidi entaw woosseysa odees. Iya kiittas gul7a qofay, “Wongelan Xoossa xillotethay qoncis; he xillotethay koyrope wursethi gakanaw ammanon qoncis” gidi odees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">1:17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Hessafe guye, he qofa dalgisidi xaafees. Ayhudeta gidin Ayhude gidonna ase gidin, ubbay nagari haarin de7ida gisho, enti Xoossara sigetanaw koshshees. Asay Xoossara sigetanaw danda7ey Yesuus Kiristoosa ammanonna. Enti Xoossara medhiya ooratha gahetetha ayfey, ooratha de7o gideysa Phawuloosi dalgisidi odees. Ammaniya asi Xoossara saro de7ees; qassi Xoossa Ayyaana baggara nagarapenne hayqo wolqafe kessi ekees. Shempo 5-8 gakanaw Phawuloosi Xoossa higgeynne ammaniya asa de7on oothiya Xoossa Ayyaana wolqa qofay aybeko odees. Hessafe kaallidi, Phawuloosi, “Xoossay asa na7as qopida qofa giddon Ayhudetinne Ayhude gidonna asay waanidi issife waaxetanaw danda7ii?” giya oyshaas zaaro immanaw baaxetis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Qassi Ayhudeti Yesuusa ekonna ixiday Xoossa qofa gideysa odees. Hessi haniday Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara qoncisida aadho keehatetha giddon asa zare ubba haphana melasa. Gidoshin, Ayhudeti Yesuusa ekana wodey yaanaysa Phawuloosi ammanees. Wursethan Phawuloosi ammano de7o waanidi daanaw bessiyako odees. Xoossas oothanaba, ammaniya asati banta biittasinne banta giddon issoy issuwas aawatethan oothanabaanne kahaa gaason medhetiya oyshetaba qoncisidi odees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Roome kiita huuphe qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:16-17">1:16-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asa na7as atotethi koshshees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18—3:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi ase ashshiya oge <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21—4:25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosan bentiya ooratha de7o <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1—8:39</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi Isra7eeles qopiya qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1—11:36</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniya asa duussa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1—15:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuusha qofanne sarotho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14—16:27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Yesuus Kiristoosa aylle gidida, hawaare gidana mela xeegetidaysafenne Xoossaa Wongela sabbakana mela dooretida Phawuloosi kiitida kiitaa.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Xoossay daro wodepe sinthe ba nabeta baggara immana yaagida Xoossaa Wongelay Geeshsha Maxaafatan xaafetis. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>He Wongelay ashon Dawita sheeshape yeletida, Xoossaa Na7aa, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosaba. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Qassi I ba geeshsha Ayyaanan hayqope dendidi, Xoossaa Na7aa gideysa gita wolqan bessis. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Iya baggara Ayhude gidonna asa ubbay, ammanidi kiitetana mela Kiristoosa sunthaa gisho, Xoossay aadho keehatethinne hawaaretetha maata nuus immis. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Yesuus Kiristoosas gidana mela xeegetida asatape baggati hintena.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Roomen de7iya, Xoossay siiqeysatasinne iya geeshsha dere gidana mela dooridaysatas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Xoossaa nu Aawapenne Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosape aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hintew gido.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Ubbaafe koyrottada, hinte ammanoy biitta ubban si7etida gisho, Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara hinte gisho ta Xoossaa galatayis. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Taani iya Na7aa wongelaba kumetha wozanan odiya Xoossay, taani ta woosan ubba wode hintena qopeysas I marka. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Wursethan, Xoossaa shene gidiko, taani hinteko baanaw ogey taw injetana mela ubba wode woossayis. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Taani hintew Ayyaana imuwa shaakanawunne hintena be7anaw laamotayis. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Hessika, taani hinte ammanuwan, qassi hinte ta ammanuwan minettana melasa.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ta ishato, taani Ayhude gidonna asaape ayfe demmidaysada, hintefeka ayfe demmanaw hinteko baanaw qopas, shin digetas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Hawa 19:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Tamaarida asaasinne tamaariboonna asaas qassi cincatasinne eeyatas taw acoy de7ees.<verse eid="ROM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Hessa gisho, Roomen de7iya hintewuka wongela odanaw amottayis.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wongeli Xoossa Wolqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Iya ammaniya ubbaa, koyrottidi Ayhudeta, kaallidi Ayhude gidonnayisata ashshanaw Wongelay Xoossaa wolqaa gidiya gisho, ta Wongelan yeellatike.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar 8:38</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Xilloy ammanon de7on daana geetetidi Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafetis. Wongelan Xoossaa xillotethay qoncis; koyrope wursethi gakanaw, asay xilley ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ibra 2:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Iitatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Tumay eretonna mela banta iita ooson kammiya asaa bollanne nagara ubbaa bolla, Xoossaa hanqoy salope wodhees. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Xoossay entaw qoncanaw bessiyaba qoncisida gisho, enti Xoossaba eroosona. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Alamey medhetoosape doomidi, asaas bentonna Xoossaa kandoy, hessika iya merinaa wolqaynne Xoossatethay iya medhetethan qoncidi de7iya gisho, asay banta iitatethaas gaasoyabay baawa.<verse eid="ROM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Enti Xoossaa erishe, iya bonchibookonanne galatibookona. Enta qofay maaddonnaba gidis; enta akeekona wozanay dhumis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Efe 4:17-18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Enti bantana cincata goosona, shin eeyata. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Enti hayqonna Xoossaa goyinnanaysa aggidi, hayqiya asa medhon, kafota medhon, do7ata medhoninne ulora gooshetiyabata daanisidi oothida misileta goyinnidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Zaare 4:16-18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Hessa gisho, enti issoy issuwara borsoba oothidi, banta asatethaa kawushana mela Xoossay enta wozanay amotiya tuna oosos enta yeggi aggis. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Hessi haniday enti Xoossaa tumaa wordon laammida gishonne medhida Xoossaa aggidi, medhetethi goyinnida gishosa. Xoossay merinaw galatetidaysa. Amin7i.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay entana enta borso amuwas yeggi aggis. Enta maccasay bantaw bessiya addera gahetethi aggidi, bessonnaba hanidi maccasi maccasara gahetidosona. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Hessadaka, addeti bantaw bessiya maccasara gahetethi aggidi, addey addera gahetidosona. Addeti issoy issuwara amon xuugetidi, borsoba oothidosona. Banta oothida nagaraas bessiya pirdaa ekidosona.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Enti Xoossaa erishe, hari attoshin iyabaa qopanaw koyonna ixida gisho, bessonnaba oothana mela Xoossay entana pathonna qofas aathidi immis. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Entan geellatethi, iitatethi, yiiqey, geney, qanaatey, shempo wodhoy, palami, cimoynne iita amoy kumis. Enti zigireyisata, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>asa sunthi iisseyisata, Xoossaa ixeyisata, cayeyisata, otoreyisata, ceeqeteyisata, iitabaa oothanaw koyeysatanne banta aayesinne aawas kiitetonayisata, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>akeekonayisata, caaqo mentheyisata, siiqoy baynayisata, qadhey baynayisata. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Hayisata mela ootheysatas hayqoy bessees giya Xoossaa higgiya erishe, haysata oothosona. Enti bantaw ooso xalaala gidonashin, oothiya harataka nashshoosona.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Xillo Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Hessa gisho, neno harata bolla pirdeyso, neeni gaasoyabay baawa. Neeni harata bolla pirdashe, he neeni pirdiya uraa mela oothiko, neeni, ne bolla pirdaasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Maato 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luqa 6:37</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Hessa mela ooso ootheyisata bolla Xoossay xillo pirdaa pirdeysa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Neno, hessa mela ooso ootheyisata bolla pirdeyso, enti ootheysa mela ootheyso, neeni Xoossaa pirdaafe attanaba daanii? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Woyko Xoossaa keehatetha, gencanne danda7a darotethaa kadhayee? Xoossay new keehiday nena nagaraape zaaranaw gideysa erikiyee?<verse eid="ROM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Shin hintew shucha wozaninne si7onna haythi de7ees. Hessa gisho, Xoossaa hanqoynne xillo pirday qonciya gallas, ne bolla pirday darana mela oothaasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Xoossay issuwas issuwas iya oosuwa mela immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Leemi 24:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Lo77o ooson minnidi, galataa, bonchonne dhayonna de7uwa koyeysatas Xoossay merinaa de7uwa immana. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Shin bantana siiqeyisata, tumaa ixeysatanne iitabaa oothanaw koyeyisata bolla Xoossaa hanqoynne pirday yaana. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Iitabaa oothiya asa ubbaa, koyrottidi Ayhudeta, kaallidi Ayhude gidonna asaa metoynne waayey gakana. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Shin Xoossay lo77o ooso oothiya ubbaas, koyrottidi Ayhudetas, kaallidi Ayhude gidonaysatas galataa, bonchonne sarotethaa immana. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Xoossay som7o be7idi ase shaakenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Higgey bayna nagara oothida ubbay higgey bayna dhayana. Higgey de7ishin, nagara oothida ubbay higgen pirdetana. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Xoossaa sinthan xilleysati higge naageysatape attishin, higge sissa xalaala si7eyisata gidokona. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Higgey bayna Ayhude gidonna asay medhon higgey kiitteysa oothosona. Entaw xaafetida higgey bayna ixikoka enti banta wozanan higgiya eroosona. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Enta hanotay, higge kiitay enta wozanan xaafetidaysa bessees. Qassi enta kahay enta bolla markatees. Enta qofay issi issi toho entana bala gees; issi issi toho entana like gees. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Ta tamaarsida Wongela mela Xoossay Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara asa wozanan geemmida qofaa pirdiya wode hessi eretana.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudetanne Enta Higgiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Shin ne nena Ayhude gaasa; higgen zempaasa; Xoossan ceeqasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Ne oothana mela Xoossay koyiyabay aybeko eraasa. Higgiya tamaarida gisho, tuma gidiyaba dooranaw eraasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Neeni qooqeta kaaletheysa, qassi dhuman de7eysatas poo7o gideysa shaaka eraasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Neeni higgiyafe demmida eratethaninne tumatethan eeyata eriseysanne yoogata tamaarseysa gideysa eraasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Yaatin, ne harata tamaarseysi ne nena ayis tamaarsikii? Neeni, “Kaysotopa” gashe, neeni ne huuphen kaysotayee? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Neeni, “Laammofa” gashe, neeni ne huuphen laammayee? Neeni eeqa ixashe, eeqay de7iya keethaa bonqayee? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Neeni Xoossaa higgiyan ceeqetasa, shin higgiyas kiitetonna ixada Xoossaa yeellayay? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Hinte gaason Xoossaa sunthay Ayhude gidonna asatan cayetees” geetetidi xaafetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa 59:7-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Ne higges kiitetiko, ne qaxaretethaas maadey de7ees, shin neeni higgiyas kiitetonna ixiko ne qaxaretethay qaxaretiboona mela gidees. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Ayhude gidonna asi qaxaretonna de7ishe, higgiyas kiitetiko, Xoossay iya qaxaretida mela taybennee? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Hinte, Ayhude asati, hintew xaafetida higgeynne qaxaroy de7ishin, hinte higges kiitetonna ixiko, Ayhude gidonna asay qaxaretonna ixikoka higges kiitetidi, hinte bolla pirdana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hinte bolla pirdana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enta hanotay woyko enta kiitetethay hinte bolla pirdana.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Hiza, sunthan Ayhude gidida ubbay tuma Ayhude gidenna. Qassi kare asatethaa qaxaroy tuma qaxaro gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Shin tuma Ayhudetethi gaatha baggan Ayhude gideysa. Tuma qaxaretethi Xoossaa Ayyaanan oosetiya wozana qaxaretethafe attishin, xaafetida higgiyan oosetiya asatethaa qaxaro gidenna. He uray galataa Xoossafe ekeesipe attishin, asape gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Zaare 30:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudeta Ammano Ixo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Yaatin, Ayhude giddon ay dummatethi de7ii? Woyko qaxaretethan ay maadey de7ii? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Tumaka Ayhude gidoy daro ogera maaddees. Ubbaafe sinthe Xoossay ba qaala hadara Ayhudetas immis.<verse eid="ROM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Yaatin, entafe issoti issoti qaala ammanonna ixiko, enta ixoy Xoossaa ammanetetha diggiyee? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Diggenna! Asa ubbay wordancho gidikoka Xoossay tuma gido. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Ne qaalan ne xillaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">nena mooteysa pirdan lathaasa”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:4">geetetidi xaafetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Maz 51:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Yaatin, nu nagaray Xoossay xillo gideysa bessiyaba gidiko, nu woyganee? Xoossay nu nagaraa gisho, nu bolla pirdiko, like gidenneyee? Haysa taani asa qofatho gayis. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Hessi ubbaraka hanenna. Hessada haniko, Xoossay ha alamiya bolla waati pirdanee?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Shin ta wordotethay Xoossa tumaa qoncisidi, iya bonchuwa darsi bessiyaba gidiko, yaatin, ayis ta bolla nagaranchoda pirdeetii? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Issi issi asay, “Lo77oy yaana mela iita oothoos” yaagidi tamaarsiyada oothidi tana mootosona. Hessa mela asaa bolla yaa Xoossaa pirday like.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi Ubbay Nagarancho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Yaatin, nuuni woyganee? Nu Ayhudeti, Ayhude gidonaysatape aadhonayee? Gidenna! Ayhude gidin, Ayhude gidonna ixin ubbay nagarancho gideysa taani kasetada hintew odas.<verse eid="ROM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Xillo asi issoyka baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Maz 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53:1-3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Akeekiya asi baawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Xoossaa koyiya oonika baawa.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Asa ubbay Xoossaas zoko zaaridosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">ubbay issife pathonnaba gididosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Lo77o oothiya oonika baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">issi asika baawa.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Enta doonape keyiya qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">dooyetida duufope keyiya xinqo mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">banta inxarsan cimmoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Enta doonape ase wodhiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">shoosha marzey keyees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Maz 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:3">140:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Enta doonan camo odaynne baadethi kumis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Maz 10:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Enti suuthi gussanaw ellesoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa 59:7-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Enta ogiyan dhayoynne qohoy de7ees.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Enti sarotetha ogiya erokona.<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Banta de7uwan Xoossaas yayyokonna”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:18">geetetidi xaafetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Maz 36:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Ase ubbaa doona oythanawunne kumetha alamiya Xoossaa pirdaafe garsan shiishanaw, higgey imetiday higgefe garsan aqeysatas gideysa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Hessa gisho, oonika higges kiitetidi Xoossaa sinthan xillanaw danda7enna. Higgey asi ubbay nagarancho gideysa bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Maz 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gala 2:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillotethi Ammanona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Shin ha77i Xoossay asi higgey baynashin xilliya oge qoncisis. He ogiya Muse higgeynne nabeti markatidosona. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Ha xillotethaa, Xoossay Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara asa ubbaas shaakoy bayna immees.<verse eid="ROM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Asa ubbay nagara oothidosona; Xoossay entaw immida bonchuwafe haakidi attidosona. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Shin enti Xoossaa aadho keehatethan, woziya Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara coo xillidosona. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Xoossay Yesuus Kiristoosa yarsho oothidi immiday, iya ammaniya ubbay iya suuthan nagara atotethi demmana melasa. Xoossay hessa oothiday ba danda7an kase nagaraa taybonna aggidi, ba xillotethaa bessanaasa. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Ha77i wodiyan Yesuusa ammaniya ubbaa xillisidi, Xoossay ba huuphen xillo gideysa bessees.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Yaatin, nu ceeqetiyabay aybi de7ii? Aybika baawa. Nuuni ceeqetey higges kiitetiya gishoyee? Akay! Ammano gishosa. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Xoossay ase xillisey ammanonape attishin, higges kiitetethan gidonnaysa nu akeekos.<verse eid="ROM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Woyko Xoossay Ayhudeta xalaala Xoosseyee? Ayhude gidonaysatas Xoosse gidenneyee? Tuma, Ayhude gidonaysataska I Xoosse. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Xoossay isso; Ayhudetanne Ayhude gidonnayisata ammanon xillisey iya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Zaare 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gala 3:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Yaatin, nuuni higgiya ammano gisho shaaros guusseyee? Gidenna! Higgiya minthosipe attishin.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Abrahaamey Ammanon Xillis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Yaatin, nu mayzay Abrahaamey ay demmidee? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Abrahaamey ooson xillidaba gidiyako, I ceeqetiyabay de7ees, gidoshin, Xoossaa sinthan ceeqetanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, “Abrahaamey Xoossaa ammanis; Xoossay hessa iyaw xillotethi oothidi ekis” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medhe 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gala 3:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Oothiya uray ekiya damoozey, iya ooso wolqaas cigetiya gatepe attishin, iyaw imota gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Shin ooso oothonna oonika nagaranchuwa xillisiya Xoossaa ammaniko, iya ammanoy iyaw xillotethi gididi taybetees. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan Dawiti, oosoy bayna Xoossay xillisiya asati ay mela anjetidako haysada yaagidi qoncisees:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Enta balay atto geetetidaysatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">enta nagaray kametidaysati anjetidaysata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Maz 32:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Goday iya nagaraa taybonna asi anjetidaysa” yaagees.<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Yaatin, Dawiti odida anjoy qaxaretida asaa xalaalaseyee? Woyko qaxaretiboona asaasee? Nuuni, “Geeshsha Maxaafay, ‘Abrahaamey Xoossaa ammanis; Xoossay hessa iyaw xillotethi oothidi ekis’ yaagees” gida. <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Yaatin, hessi awude hanidee? Abrahaamey qaxaretineyee? Woyko qaxaretona de7ishinee? Qaxaretanaape sinthe hanisipe attishin, guye gidenna.<verse eid="ROM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Abrahaamey qaxaretanaape sinthe iya ammanoy iyaw xillotethi gididi taybetidaysa erisanaw, iya qaxaroy malaata gidis. Hessa gisho, Abrahaamey qaxaretonna ammaneysatasinne ammanon xilleyisata ubbaas aawa gidis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medhe 17:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>I qaxaretidaysataska aawa. Abrahaamey entaw aawa gididay enti qaxaretida gisho, xalaalas gidonashin, I qaxaretanaape sinthe ammanida ammanuwa enti kaallida gishosa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Abrahaamesinne iya sheeshas, “Alamiya ta hintew immana” yaagida ufaysay, Abrahaamey ammanon xillida gishosafe attishin, higge naagidi polida gisho gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Medhe 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gala 3:29</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Higges kiitetidaysati Xoossay immana gida ufaysa laateyisata gidiko, asaa ammanoy maaddenna; Xoossaa ufaysay hada gidis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gala 3:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Higge menthoy Xoossaa hanqo ehees, shin higgey baynason higge menthoy baawa.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay immida ufaysay ammanon eketees. Ha ufaysay Abrahaame sheesha ubbaas Xoossaa aadho keehatetha baggara imetidaysa qoncisees. Hessika higge naageysata xalaalas gidonashin, Abrahaameda ammanida ubbaasa. Abrahaamey nu ubbaas aawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gala 3:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ta nena daro kawotethatas aawa oothas” geetetidi Abrahaame gisho, xaafetis. Ha ufaysay Abrahaames imetiday hayqidaysatas de7o immeysinne oorathaba oothiya Xoossay iya gideysa I ammanida gishosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Medhe 17:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Xoossay Abrahaames daro koche immanaysa caaqis. Ufaysi oothanaw aykoka danda7etonna wode Abrahaamey Xoossan ammanida gishonne ufaysi oothida gisho, daro kawotethatas aawa gidis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medhe 15:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Abrahaames xeetu laythi kumana hanikoka, ba daaburida asatethanne Saara na7a yelanaw danda7onnaysa erishe ba ammanuwan daaburibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Medhe 17:17</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Gidoshin, I ba ammanuwan minnidi Xoossaas boncho immispe attishin, Xoossay immida ufaysaa ammanonna ixidi, sidhibeenna. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Abrahaamey, Xoossay caaqida caaquwa polanaysa ba kumetha wozanan ammanis. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay iya ammanuwa xillotethan taybis.<verse eid="ROM 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Shin, “Iyaw xillotethan taybis” giya qaalay Abrahaame xalaalas xaafetibeenna. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>He qaalay nu Godaa Yesuusa hayqope denthida Xoossaa ammaniya nuuska nu ammanoy xillotethan taybetana mela xaafetis. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Xoossay iya nu nagara gisho, hayqos aathidi immis; I nuna xillisanaw hayqope dendis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa 53:4-5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossan De7iya Sarotethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Hiza, nu ammanon xillida gisho, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara Xoossara nuus sarotethi de7ees. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Nuuni iya baggara ha77i nu eqida aadho keehatetha giddo ammanon gelida. Hessa gisho, nu Xoossaa bonchuwa shaaketanaw de7iya ufaysan ceeqetoos.<verse eid="ROM 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Hessa xalaala gidonashin, metoy danda7a eheysa nu eriya gisho, nu metuwanka ceeqetoos. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>Qassi danda7ay genca, gencay ufaysi immeysa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Nuus immida Geeshsha Ayyaana baggara Xoossay ba siiquwa nu wozanan gussida gisho he ufaysay nuna yeellayenna.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Nuuni buroo daaburanchota gididi de7ishin, Xoossaa wodey gakin, Kiristoosi nagaranchota gisho hayqis. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Xillo asa gisho hayqana asi demmanaysi daro meto, shin keeha asa gisho hayqana asi ooni eri bentonna aggenna. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Shin nuuni buroo nagarancho gididi de7ishin, Kiristoosi nu gisho hayqis. Hessi Xoossay nuna ay mela siiqiyako iya siiquwa bessees. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Hiza, nuuni Kiristoosa suuthan xillidaba gidiko, ubbaafe aathidi iya baggara Xoossaa hanquwafe attana. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Nuuni Xoossara kase morke, shin iya Na7aa hayquwan iyara sigetida. Hessafe aathidi, ha77i nuuni Xoossara sigetidaape guye, iya na7aa de7uwa gaason nuuni attana. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Hessa xalaala gidonashin, ha77i nuna Xoossara sigethida nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara nu Xoossan ceeqetoos.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Addaamenne Kiristoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Addaame baggara nagari ha alamiya gelis. He nagaraa baggara hayqoy yis. Asi ubbay nagara oothida gisho hayqoy asa zare ubbaa gakis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Medhe 3:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Higgey imetanaape sinthe alamen nagari de7ees, shin higgey bayna wode nagari nagara gididi taybetenna. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Shin Addaamepe Muse gakanaw hayqoy asa ubbaa haaris. Hari attoshin, Addaameda higges kiitetonna ixidi, nagara oothiboonayisata bollaka hayqoy kawotis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Addaamey yaana Yesuusas leemiso. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Shin Xoossaa aadho keehatethay Addaame nagaraa mela gidenna. Issi asa nagara baggara daro asay hayqis. Shin Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara Xoossaa aadho keehatethay asa ubbaas daridi imetis. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Addaame nagaraa giddoninne Xoossaa imota giddon daro dummatethi de7ees. Issi asa nagara gaason Xoossay iya bolla pirdis. Shin asay daro nagara oothinka Xoossaa aadho keehatethay xillotethaa ehis. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Issi asa nagara gaason hayqoy asa ubbaa bolla kawotis. Shin Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara Xoossaa aadho keehatethaanne xillotetha imota ekiya ubbay, xoono de7on de7oosona.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Hiza, issi asi nagara oothida gaason asa ubbaa bolla pirdi yidaysada issi asi xillo oothida gaason, Xoossay ase ubbaa xillisidi entaw de7o immees. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Issi asi kiitetonna ixida gaason, daro asay nagarancho gididaysada issi asa kiitetethan daro asay xillana.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Asay nagara wolqaa erana mela higgey yis, shin nagara wolqay darida wode Xoossaa aadho keehatethay aadhidi daris. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nagari hayqo wolqan kawotidaysa mela Xoossa aadho keehatethay xillotethaa wolqan kawotidi, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara nuna merinaa de7uwako kaalethees.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagaras Hayqo Kiristoosas De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Yaatin, nuuni woyganee? Xoossaa aadho keehatethay darana mela nagaran minnidi de7ino? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Akay, nuuni nagaras hayqidaba gidiko, yaatin, nuuni hizape waanidi nagaran daanee? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Nu ubbay Kiristoos Yesuusara issifanaw xammaqetida wode iya hayquwan iyara issifanaw xammaqetidaysa ereketiyee? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Nu xammaqetida wode Kiristoosara hayqidanne moogetida. Kiristoosi Xoossaa Aawa boncho wolqan hayqope dendidaysa mela nuka ooratha de7on daana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Qola 2:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Nu iya hayquwan iyara issino gidiko, hessadaka, iya denduwan iyara issino gidana. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Nu hizape nagaras aylle gidonna melanne nu nagarancho asatethaa wolqay dhayana mela nu cima asatethay Kiristoosara kaqetidaysa eroos. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Issi asi Kiristoosan hayqidaba gidiko, I nagara wolqafe la77a keyis. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Nuuni Kiristoosara hayqiko, iyara de7on daanaysa ammanoos. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Kiristoosi hayqope dendida gisho, zaari I hayqonaysanne hayqoy sinthafe iya haaronnaysa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>I hayqida wode nagaras issitoho wursethi gakanaw hayqis, shin ha77i de7on Xoossaas de7ees. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Hessadaka, hinte nagaras hayqidi, Godaa Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara Xoossas de7on de7eysa qopite.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Hessa gisho, hinte, hinte asatethaa amuwas kiitetonna mela hayqiya hinte asatethaa nagari haaropo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Qassi hinte asatethaa nagara oothanaw geellatetha miishe oothidi immofite. Shin hinte hayqope dendidi, de7on de7iya asada hinte asatethaa Xoossaas immite. Qassi hinte kumetha asatethaa xillo ooso oothanaw Xoossaas aathidi immite. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Hinte Xoossaa aadho keehatetha garsan de7eetape attishin, higgefe garsan de7onna gisho nagari hintena haaranaw bessenna.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillotetha Aylle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Yaatin, nu woyganee? Higgefe garsan gidonashin, Xoossaa aadho keehatetha garsan de7iya gisho nagara oothaneyee? Akay! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Hinte issi asas kiitetanaw hintena aylle oothidi immiya wode he hinte kiiteteysas aylle gideysa ereeta. Hessadaka, hinte nagaras kiitetiko, hintew hayqo ehiya nagaraas aylle gideeta. Woyko hinte Xoossas kiitetiko xillotethi ehiya Xoossaas aylle gideeta. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Kase hinte nagaras aylle, shin ha77i hinte ekida tuma timirtiyas kumetha wozanape kiitetida gisho Xoossaas galati gido. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Hinte nagara aylletetha qashope biletidi xillotetha aylle gidideta.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Hinte hinte qofan daaburancho gidiya gisho, taani oodeska geliya ogen odayis. Kase hinte, hinte asatethaa tunanne iitabaa oothanaw aylle oothidi immidaysa mela ha77i hinte asatethaa geeshshi gidana mela xillotetha aylle oothidi immite.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Hinte nagaras aylletidi de7iya wode xillotethas haareteketa. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Hintena ha77i yeellayiya beni hinte iita oosuwape ay maade demmidetii? He oosota wursethay hayqo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Shin hinte nagara aylletetha qashope biletidi, Xoossaas aylle gidideta. Hessi hintena geeshshi oothidi merinaa de7uwako kaalethees. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Nagara gatey hayqo. Shin Xoossay, nu Godaa Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara immiya imotay merinaa de7o.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Eko Gelo Leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ta ishato, taani odey higge eriya asatasa. Higgey issi asi paxa de7iya wode ubban iya haarees. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Leemisos, azina gelida maccasiya I azinay paxa de7iya wode higgen iyara qashetasu. Shin I azinay hayqiko iyara iya caaqida caaqoy iyo haarenna. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Hessa gisho, iya ba azinay paxa de7ishin, hara adde geliko, iya laammidaaro geetetawusu. Shin I azinay hayqiko, caaqoy iyo haaronna gisho iya hara azina geliko, iya laammidaaro geetetuku.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Hessa gisho, ta ishato, hinte Kiristoosa asatethaa baggara higge wolqaas hayqidi, Xoossaas ayfe ayfanaw hayqope dendida Kiristoosas gidideta. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Nu asho amoy nuna haarin, nu de7iya wode higgey guji nagara oothana mela nuna denthethees. Nu asatethaa giddon iita amotethi de7iya gisho nuuni hayqo ayfe ayfana mela oothis. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Shin ha77i nuuni nuna qachida higgiyas hayqida gisho nuuni higge qashope biletida. Hessa gisho, Geeshsha Ayyaana ogen Xoossaas kiitetosipe attishin, xaafetida cima higgiyas kiitetoko.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higgenne Nagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Yaatin, nuuni woyganee? Higgey ba huuphen nagaree? Gidenna! Shin higgey nagari aybeko tana erisis. Higgey, “Amotofa” goonnako, amotethi aybeko taani erike.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Kessa 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Zaare 5:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Shin ta ubbaba amottana mela nagari higge baggara tanan oge demmis. Higgey bayneko nagari hayqidaysa.<verse eid="ROM 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Kase higgey bayna wode ta paxa, shin higgey imetida wode nagari paxin ta qassi hayqas. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Taani de7on daana mela Xoossay immida higgey taw hayqo ehis. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Nagari higge baggara tana cimmiya ogiya demmidi, wodhis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Medhe 3:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Hessa gisho, higgey geeshshi; iyan xaafetida kiitayka geeshshi, xillonne lo77o.<verse eid="ROM 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Yaatin, lo77o gididabay ta bolla hayqo ehideyee? Gidenna! Shin nagari nagara gideysi qoncana mela lo77oban maaddetidi taw hayqo ehis. Hessa gisho, nagara nagaratethay higge baggara aadhidi eretis.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Nuuni higgey ayyaanaba gideysa eroos. Shin taani nagaras bayzetida asho asi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Taani oothiyaba akeekike; taani dosiyaba oothanaysa aggada ta ixiyaba oothayis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gala 5:17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Taani ixiyaba oothiya gidiko, higgey lo77o gideysa ta ma7ayis. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Hessa gidiko, he oosuwa tanan de7iya nagaray oothaysipe attishin, ta oothike.<verse eid="ROM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Tanan, hessika ta ashuwan lo77obay baynaysa erayis. Lo77oba oothiya amotethi tanan de7ees, shin lo77oba oothanaw danda7ike. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Taani ixiya iitabaa oothaysipe attishin, ta dosiya lo77oba oothike. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Taani ixiyaba oothiya gidiko, hessa tanan de7iya nagaray ootheesipe attishin, oothey tana gidike.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Hiza, ta lo77oba oothanaw dosishin, iitabaa oosoy woga gideysa demmas. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Taani ta wozanan Xoossaa higgiyan ufaytayis. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Shin ta asatethaa giddon de7iya ta qofaa higgiyara oletiya dumma higge be7ayis. He higgey ta asatethaa giddon oothiya nagara higgiyas tana aylle oothidi immis. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Taani waanida yibbata asee? Hayqos efiya ha asatethafe tana ashshanay oonee? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara tana ashshiya Xoossaas galatay gido.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Hiza, taani ta qofan Xoossaa higgiyas haaretayis; shin ta asatethan tana nagara oosisiya higgiyas haaretayis.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Ayyaanan De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Hessa gisho, Kiristoos Yesuusan de7eysati ha77i pirdetokona. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara nuus de7o immiya Geeshsha Ayyaana higgey, tana nagaranne hayqo higge aylletethaafe kessis. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Nu nagara asatethaa gaason, higgey daaburancho gidiya gisho nuna ashshanaw danda7ibeenna. Xoossay ba na7aa nagarancho asa leemison nagaras yarsho gidana mela kiittidi hessa oothis. Yaatidi, Xoossay Kiristoosa ashuwa baggara nagara, nagarancho asa giddon pirdis. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Xoossay hessa oothiday, nu asho amoy koyeysada gidonashin, Geeshsha Ayyaanay koyeysada de7iya nu bolla higgiya xillo kiitay poletana melasa.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Banta asho amuwa kaallidi de7eysati bantana ufaysiyabaa qopoosona. Shin Geeshsha Ayyaana shenen de7eysati Geeshsha Ayyaana ufaysiyabaa qopoosona. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Nu qofay asho amos haaretiko hayqo ehees, shin ayyaana amos haaretiko de7onne sarotethi ehees. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Asho amos haaretiya asi Xoossaa higgiyas kiitetanaw koyonna gishonne kiitetanaw danda7onna gisho, Xoossara morke. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Banta asho amuwas haareteysati Xoossaa ufaysanaw danda7okona.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Shin Xoossaa Ayyaanay hintenan de7ikonne hintena haariko, hinte Ayyaana shenen de7eetape attishin, hinte asho amuwas haareteketa. Kiristoosa Ayyaanay bayna oonika Kiristoosaba gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Shin Kiristoosi hintenan de7iko, hinte asatethay nagara gaason hayqidaysa. Shin hinte ayyaanay xillotethaa gaason de7on de7ees. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Shin Yesuusa hayqope denthida Xoossaa Ayyaanay hintenan de7iko, Kiristoosa hayqope denthida Xoossay, hintenan de7iya ba Geeshsha Ayyaanan hayqiya hinte asatethaas de7o immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:16">2 Qoro 3:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Hiza, ta ishato, nuuni nu asho amuwa kaallidi daanaw bessenna. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Hinte, hinte asho amuwas de7iko hayqana, shin Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqan nagara oosuwa wodhiko hinte de7on daana. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Xoossaa Ayyaanay kaalethiya ubbay Xoossaa nayta. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Nuuni, “Abbaa, ta Aawaw” yaagidi xeegiya, Xoossaa nayta oothiya Geeshsha Ayyaana ekidaape attishin, zaaridi yashshan daanaw aylle oothiya ayyaana ekibooko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gala 4:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Xoossaa Ayyaanay nu ayyaanara gididi nuuni Xoossaa nayta gideysa markatees. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Nuuni iya nayta gidiko Xoossaa anjuwa laattana; Kiristoosara wolla he anjuwa laattana. Qassi nuuni Kiristoosara metuwa ekiko iyara wolla iya bonchuwan shaaketana.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaana Bonchuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Nuuni ha77i waayetiya waayiya, sinthafe nuus qoncana bonchuwara gathi be7iko, ginisanaw danda7etenna gada qopayis. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Medhetetha ubbay Xoossaa nayta qoncethaa daro laamotidi naagoosona. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Medhetetha ubbay hada gidis; hessika, medhetetha dooron gidonashin, ufaysan naagana mela oothida Xoossaa shenen hanis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Medhe 3:17-19</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Medhetethay ba huuphen dhayo aylletethaafe wozetidi, Xoossaa naytara wolla boncho la77a shaaketana. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Medhetethay issife hanno gakanaw iqethi oykida maccasada ooleninne un7an de7eysa nu eroos. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Qassi hessa medhetetha xalaala gidonashin, Geeshsha Ayyaana bayra imotada ekida nuuni, nu huuphen nu asatethaas wozo gidida Xoossaa nayta gidana ufaysaa naagishe nu asatethan oolos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2 Qoro 5:2-4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Ha ufaysan nuuni attida. Shin nuuni ufaysi oothiyabay bentiya gidiko hessa ooni ufaysi oothii? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Shin nu be7onnaba demmana gidi ufaysan naagiko hessa danda7an naagoos.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Hessada Geeshsha Ayyaanay nu daaburan maaddees. Nuuni Xoossaa waati woossanaw bessiyako eroko, shin Geeshsha Ayyaanay ba huuphen, asi odanaw danda7etonna qaalan nuus gaannatees. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Qassi asa wozana eriya Xoossay Geeshsha Ayyaana qofay aybeko erees. Geeshsha Ayyaanay Xoossaa sheniyada geeshshatas gaannatees.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Xoossaa siiqeysatasinne iya sheniyada xeegetidaysatas Xoossay ubbaa lo77os ootheysa eroos. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Xoossay koyrottidi eridaysati ba Na7aa daanana melanne na7ayka ammaneyisata giddon bayra gidana mela enta dummayidi wothis. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Xoossay koyrottidi dummayidaysata xeegis; he xeegidaysata xillisis; he xillisidaysata qassi bonchis.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Yaatin, nu ha ubbaas woyganee? Xoossay nu bagga gidiko nuura oone eqetanay? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>I hari attoshin, ba na7aas qadhetonnashin, nu gisho aathidi immis. Yaatin, ba na7aa nuus aathidi immidaysi waanidi ubbaba coo immennee?<verse eid="ROM 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Xoossay entana xillisida gisho I dooridaysata oone mootanay? <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Yaatin, enta bolla pirdanaw danda7ey oonee? Oonika baawa. Hayqope dendidi Xoossaa ushachan uttida, Kiristoos Yesuusi, I nuus gaannatees.<verse eid="ROM 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Hiza, nuna Kiristoosa siiquwape shaakanay oonee? Waayeye woyko metoye woyko goodeye woyko kosheye woyko kallotetheye woyko yashsheye woyko oleyee? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Nuuni ne gisho kumetha gallas hayqoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">shukas efiya dorsada taybetida”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:2">Maz 44:2</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 8:36">geetetidi xaafetidaysa mela gidis.<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Shin nuuni, nuna siiqida Kiristoosan ha ubbaa polo xoonos.<verse eid="ROM 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Hessa gisho, hayqo gidin de7o gidin kiitanchota gidin haareyisata gidin ha77i de7eysa gidin sinthafe yaanaysa gidin wolqaamata gidin, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>salo wolqaa gidin sa7a wolqaa gidin ay medhetethi gidin nu Godaa, Kiristoos Yesuusan de7iya Xoossaa siiquwape nuna shaakanaw danda7onnaysa taani eras.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Dooretethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Taani Kiristoosan tuma odayis, wordotike. Geeshsha Ayyaanay kaalethiya ta kahay taani wordotonnaysa taw markatees. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Ta wozanan Isra7eeletas daro qadhetaysinne qamma gallas qopayis. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Taani, ta ishata gisho, Kiristoosape shaaketada Xoossaa baadethafe garsan de7idaako dosaysishin. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Enti Isra7eeleta, Xoossay enta ba nayta oothis, ba bonchuwa entaw qoncisis. Entara caaqis; higgiya entaw immis. Enti Xoossaa goyinnana tuma ogiya bessis; Xoossay ufaysa qaala entaw immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kessa 4:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Enti yeletethan mayzata koche; qassi Kiristoosi ashon enta koche gididi yis. Ubbaafe bolla gidida Xoossay merinaw galatetto. Amin7i!<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Gidoshin, Xoossay gelida qaalay poletonna attis guussu gidenna. Isra7eele asa ubbay Xoossaa asi gidokona. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Qassi Abrahaame zare ubbay Abrahaame nayta gidokona. Xoossay Abrahaames, “Ne kochay Yisaaqa baggara xeegetana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe 21:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Hessa guussay ashon yeletida nayti ubbay Xoossaa nayta gidokona. Shin tuma Isra7eele nayti Xoossay Abrahaames gelida qaalada yeletida nayta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe 21:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Xoossay immana gidi gelida qaalay, “Taani wonto laythi hannoode yaana; Saaraka adde na7a yelana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Medhe 18:10</ref>.</char></note> yaageysa.<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Hessa xalaala gidonashin, Irbiqinne Yisaaqi yelida mente adde naytabaa akeekite. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Enti yeletanaape woyko iita woyko lo77o oothanaape sinthe Xoossaa dooroy ooson gidonashin xeessan gideysa qoncisanaw, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>“Bayray kaaluwas kiitetana” yaagidi Goday Irbiqas odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Medhe 25:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Hessika Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Yayqooba dosas, Eesawe ixas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Milki 1:2</ref>.</char></note> geetetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Yaatin, nuuni woyganee? Xoossay ase asape shaakiyee? Gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Goday Museko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">“Ta maaranaw koydaysata maarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">ta qadhetanaw koydaysatas qadhetana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kessa 33:19</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ROM 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Hiza, Xoossaa dooroy asa shenen woyko ooson gidonashin iya maarotethaana.<verse eid="ROM 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, Gibxe kawako, “Taani, ta wolqaa nenan bessanawunne ta sunthay alame ubban eretana mela hessas nena kawothas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kessa 9:16</ref>.</char></note> geetetidi xaafetis. <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Hiza, Xoossay maaranaw koyeysa maarees; wozanaa muumisanaw koyeysa wozanaa muumisees.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Hanqonne Maarotethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Hintefe issoy, “Yaatin, Xoossay ase iita ooso gisho ayis borii? Xoossaa sheniya ixas gaanay oonee?” yaagidi oychanaw danda7ees.<verse eid="ROM 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Shin ta ishaw, Xoossara palamanaw neeni oonee? Urqafe Medhetida miishey bana medhidaysa, “Tana haysada oothada ayis medhadii?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref>.</char></note> gidi oychanaw danda7ii? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Woyko urqa medheysi issi urqafe issuwa boncho miishe, hankuwa qassi tooshe miishe oothidi medhanaw maati baawee?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Xoossay ba hanquwa bessanawunne ba wolqaa erisanaw koyidi, pirdas giigida hanqo nayta daro gencan danda7idaako ne ay eray? <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Hessa I oothiday koyrottidi bonchoos giigisida, ba doorida naytas ba bonchuwa qoncisanaasa. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Ayhude gidin, woyko Ayhude gidonna asa ubbay Xoossan dooretida.<verse eid="ROM 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Nabiya Hose maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Ta ase gidonnayisata, ‘Ta ase’ gada xeegana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Ta siiqaboonna deriya, ‘Siiqetidaysata’ gada xeegana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hose 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Enti, ‘Ta ase gideketa’ geetetidi xeegetida bessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‘De7o Xoossaa nayta’ geetetidi xeegetana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hose 1:10</ref>.</char></note> yaagees.<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Nabiya Isayaasi Isra7eele asaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Isra7eele asay abba gaxan de7iya shafeda darikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">entafe guutha asa xalaali attana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Isa 10:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Goday alamiya ubbaa bolla ellesidi polo pirdaa pirdana.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Qassika Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday nuus guutha koche ashshonaba gidiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">nuuni Soodomenne Gamoora katamaada dhayanashin”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:29">yaagidi koyrottidi odis.<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Yaatin, nu woyganee? Xillotethaa koyiboona Ayhude gidonna asay ammanon xillotethi demmidosona. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Shin xillotethako gathiya higgey de7iya Isra7eele asay xillotethi demmibookona. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Ayis demmibookona? Enti xillotethaa ammanon gidonashin, ooson ekanaw koyida gishosa. Yaaniya gisho, enti, “Dhubiya shuchan” dhubetidosona. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Taani Xiyoonen dhubbi kundisiya shuchaa wothana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Iyan ammaniya oonika yeellatenna”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:33">geetetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ta ishato, ta kumetha wozanan ta amotteynne Xoosse woossey Isra7eeley attana melasa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Enti Xoossaas mishetoosonashin, tuma eratethan mishetonnaysa ta markatayis. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Enti Xoossaa xillotethaa ogiya eronna ixidi, banta huuphe xillotethaa kaallidosonape attishin, Xoossaa xillotethaa koybookona. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Asi ubbay ammanon xillana mela Kiristoosi higgiya polis.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atotethi Ubbaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Asi higge naagidi ekiya xillotethabaa Musey xaafishe, “Higge naagiya oonika he higgiya naagida mela de7ees”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leewe 18:5</ref>.</char></note> yaagis. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Shin ammanon ekiya xillotethabaa geetetiday haysa: “Ne wozanan, ‘Ooni salo keyanee?’ yaagopa; hessi Kiristoosa wodhisanaasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Zaare 30:12-14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Woyko, ‘Duge sa7a garsi wodhanay oonee?’ goopa; hessi Kiristoosa duufope kessanaasa. <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Shin yaagidi xaafetis: ‘Xoossaa qaalay ne matana; ne doonaninne ne wozanan de7ees’ Nuuni hintew odiya ammano qaalay haysa.<verse eid="ROM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>“Yesuusi Godaa” gada ne doonan markatikonne Xoossay iya hayqope denthidaysa ne wozanan ammaniko, ne attana. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Asi ba wozanan ammanidi xillees; ba doonan markatidi attees. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, “Iyan ammaniya oonika yeellatenna”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>.</char></note> yaagees. <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Issi Xoossay ubbaa Godaa gidiya gisho, Ayhudeta giddoninne Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon dummatethi baawa. I bana xeegiya ubbaas daro keeha. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, “Godaa sunthaa xeegiya oonika attana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Iyyu 2:32</ref>.</char></note> yaagees.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Yaatin, enti ammanonna de7ishe waanidi iya xeeganaw danda7onna? Enti iyabaa si7onna de7ishe waatidi iya ammananaw danda7onna? Qassi entaw qaala odiya asi bayna de7ishin, waanidi si7anaw danda7oona? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kiitetida asi bayna de7ishin, qaalay waanidi odetanaw danda7ii? Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ufaysa Wongela odiya asaa tohoti waanidi lo77oona!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref>.</char></note> yaagidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Shin Isayaasi, “Godaw, nu markatethaa ooni ammanidee?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref>.</char></note> yaagidaysada, ubbay Wongela ammanibookona. <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Hessa gisho, ammanoy sissafe yees; sissi Kiristoosa qaalape yees.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Gidoshin, Isra7eele asay qaala si7ibookona guusseyee? Akay, si7idosona. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Enta qaalay biitta ubban si7etis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">enta oday sa7aa gaxa gakis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Maz 19:4</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:18">yaagetis. <verse eid="ROM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Shin Isra7eele asay eribookona guusseyee? Musey kase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Taani hintena leqetida asan qiiroysana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">qassi eeya asan hintena yiloyana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Zaare 32:21</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Qassi Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Tana koyiboona asaas bentas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">tana oychiboona asaas qoncas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa 65:1</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:20">yaagidi yayyonna odis.<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Shin Isayaasi Isra7eeletaba odishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Ubbaa gallas kiitetonna asaasinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">tana ixiya asaas ta kushiya miccas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa 65:2</ref>.</char></note> yaagees.<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Isra7eeleta Aggibeenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Ane ta oychayis: yaatin, Xoossay ba asaa aggideyee? Aggibeenna! Taani ta huuphen Isra7eele; Abrahaame sheeshi; Biniyaame koche.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filphi 3:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Xoossay koyro doorida ba asata yeggenna. Geeshsha Maxaafan, Eeliyaasi Isra7eeleta Xoossaa sinthan waati mootidaako, hinte ereketii? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>Eeliyaasi, “Godaw, enti ne nabeta wodhidosona, ne yarsho bessaaka laallidosona. Ta tarka attas; enti tanaka wodhanaw koyoosona”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Kawo 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ROM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Xoossay iyaw woygidi zaaridee? “Ba7aale geetetiya eeqas goyinniboona laapun mukulu asaa taw ashshas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Kawo 19:18</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ROM 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Hessadaka, ha wodiyan Xoossay ba aadho keehatethan doorida guutha Isra7eeleti de7oosona. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>I enta dooriday ba aadho keehatethanaape attishin, enta ooson gidenna. Dooroy ooson gidiko, iya aadho keehatethay tuma aadho keehatethi gidenna.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Yaatin, waanidee? Isra7eeleti banta koyaba demmibookona, shin Xoossay doorida guuthati demmidosona. Attidaysati banta wozanaa muumisidosona. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Hessika, Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Enti banta ayfiyan be7onnaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">banta haythan si7onnaada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">hanno gakanaw entaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">Xoossay azalla ayyaana immis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Zaare 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa 29:10</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:8">geetetidi xaafetidaysada hanis. <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Qassi Dawiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Enti miya gaytay enta xiheda oyko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">enta gufanthiya aafo gido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">enta iitatethay enta bolla gako.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">Maz 69:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Enti xeellonnaada enta ayfey goozeto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">ubba wode meton enti kuunidi de7o” yaagis.<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Yaatin, Ayhudeti zaari dendonna mela kundidonayee? Gidenna! Enta kundethay Ayhude gidonna asay attana mela gaaso gidis. Hessika Ayhudeti enta bolla qanaatanaada oothis. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Ayhudeta nagaray alamiyas daro anjo ehis; qassi enta kundethay Ayhude gidonna asaas daro anjo gidis. Yaatin, dooretida Ayhudeti kumethi attiya wode anjoy ay mela darandeesha!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Taani, ha77i hintew Ayhude gidonna asaas odayis. Ayhude gidonna asaas hawaare gidada ootheysan taani daro ceeqetayis. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Ta hessa oothiday taw ashon koche gidida Isra7eeleta qiiroyada entafe guuthata ashshanaasa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Xoossay enta yeggida wode, ha alamey Xoossara sigetis. Xoossay enta shiishi ekiya wode hayqida asi hayqope dendida mela gidees.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Koyro menthida baso uythay Xoossaas yarshetidi geeshshi gidiko, muume uythayka geeshshi. Mithas xaphoy geeshshi gidiko, tasheyka geeshshi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Gaden tokida shamaho tashe gidida Ayhudeti karetin, hinte bazzon dolida shamaho tashe gidida Ayhude gidonnaysati enta bessan dhanthetidi enta anjuwanne duretetha shaaketideta. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Hiza, hinte tasheda karetidi wodhida Ayhudeta bolla otortofite. Hinte otortiyaba gidiko, xaphoy hintena tookesipe attishin, hinte xaphuwa tookonnaysa akeekite.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Neeni, “He tasheti karetiday, ta enta bessan dhanthetana melasa” gaanaw danda7aasa. <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Hessi tuma. Enti ammanibona gisho karetidosona. Neeni ammanida gisho he bessan eqadasa. Neeni yayyanaw besseesipe attishin, otoranaw bessenna. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Xoossay medhon tashe gidida Ayhudetas qadhetonna ixiko hintewuka qadhetenna.<verse eid="ROM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Hiza, Xoossay ay mela keehekonne ay mela yashshiyako be7a. I yashshey kiitetonayisata, qassi I keehey iya ammanidi minnidi eqidaysatasa. Minnidi eqonna ixiko hinteka karetana. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Ayhudeti ammaniko, kase enti de7iya bessaa simmana. Xoossay enta zaaridi, wothanaw danda7ees. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Hintena bazzon de7iya shamaho gidida Ayhude gidonnayisata qanxidi, gaden tooketida shamahuwa bolla hintena tokiko, medhon gade shamaho gidida Ayhudeta banta koyro bessan zaari tokanaw waanidi danda7etennee? <figure style="fig" alt="Olive tree with its fruits" file="BK00119B.tif" size="span" ref="11:24">Shamaho Mithinne Iya Ayfiya</figure><verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Maarotethi Ubbaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ta ishato, hinte hintena erancho gidi ceeqetofite. Ta hintew odiya issi xuuri de7ees. Hessika Isra7eeletape baggay si7onna ixiday wursethi gakanaw gidonashin, attanaw de7iya Ayhude gidonna asay kumethi Xoossako yaana gakanaasa. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Hessadaka, Isra7eele asa ubbay attana. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Nuna ashsheysi Xiyoonepe yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Yayqooba kochaafe iita ubbaa diggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">Isa 59:20-21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Taani enta nagara atto giya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">entara caaqana caaqoy haysa”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Isa 27:9</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:27">geetetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Ayhudeti Wongela ekonna ixidi, hinte gisho Xoossara morke gididosona. Gidoshin, ha77ika enti dooretidaysata, Xoossay enta aawata gisho enta dosees. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Xoossay ba imuwaninne ba xeessan qiirotenna. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Hinte Ayhude gidonnaysati kase Xoossaas kiitetibeketa. Shin ha77i Ayhudeti kiitetonna ixin, hinte Xoossaa maarotethaa ekideta. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Hessadaka, hinte ekida maarotethaa Ayhudeti ekana mela ha77i Xoossaas kiitetonna ixidosona. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Xoossay asa ubbaa ba maarotethaa bessanaw koyidi, asi ubbay kiitetonna ixana mela oothis.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Xoossaa duretetha, cincatethaanne eratethaa akeekidi odanay oonee? Iya pirday pilgetenna, iya ogey eretenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa 55:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Godaa qofaa erey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Iya zoranaw danda7ey oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Xoossaas tal7eynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">tal7iya zaaridi ekey oonee?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Iyyo 41:11</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:35">yaagees.<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ubbaa I medhis; ubbay iyan de7ees; ubbay iya bonchosa. Xoossaas merinaw bonchoy gido. Amin7i.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:6">2 Qoro 8:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o Yarsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Hiza, ta ishato, hinte, hinte asatethaa Xoossaa ufaysiya, de7onne geeshsha yarsho oothidi, immana mela taani hintena Xoossaa maarotethan woossayis. Xoossaa hinte goyinnanaw bessiya tuma ogey hessa. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Lo77o, ufayseysanne polo gidida Xoossaa sheniya hinte shaaki eranaw hinte qofan laametitepe attishin, ha alamiya daanopite.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Xoossay hinte issuwas issuwas immida ammanuwa mela wozanaama asada qopite. Qopanaw besseysafe aathidi hintena dummayidi, otoron qopofite gada taw imetida aadho keehatethan hintew odayis. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Nu issi asatethaa giddon dumma dumma kifileti de7oosona; he dumma dumma kifiletas dumma dumma oosoy de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:12">2 Qoro 12:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Hessada, nuuni daro asi gidikoka, Kiristoosan issi asatethi gidida. Nuuni issi asatethi gididi dumma dumma kifileti issoy issuwara oyketida. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Nuus imetida aadho keehatethan dumma dumma imotati de7oosona. Nu imoy tinbit odo gidiko, nuus de7iya ammanuwa mela odanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:4-11">2 Qoro 12:4-11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Nu imoy harata maade gidiko, he oosuwan minnanaw bessees; tamaarso gidiko, he tamaarsuwan minnanaw bessees. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Nu imoy harata minthetho gidiko, minnidi minthethanaw bessees. Nu imoy nuus de7iyabaape haratas imo gidiko, wozanape immanaw bessees. Nu imoy ayso gidiko, minnidi aysanaw bessees. Nu imoy haratas keeho gidiko, ufaysan keehanaw bessees.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Hinte siiqoy qoodhepe qommon gidanaw bessenna. Iitaba ixite; lo77oba minthidi oykite. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Issoy issuwara ishada siiqetite; issoy issuwa bonchite. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Azallofite; hinte ayyaanan minnidi, Godaas oothite. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Xoossay immida ufaysan ufaytite; metuwa danda7ite; ubba wode Xoossaa woossite. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Ammaniya geeshshata koshshiyaban maaddite; imathata mokite.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Hintena goodeyisata anjite; anjitepe attishin, baaddofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Maato 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luqa 6:28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Ufayteysatara ufaytite; yeekeysatara yeekite. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Issoy issuwara issi qofan de7ite. Otoro qofaa aggidi, hintena kawushidi, kawusha ooso oothite. Hinte hintena cinca gidi qopofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Leemi 3:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Oonika hintew iitabaa oothiko, he uraas iita zaaropite. Asa ubbaa sinthan nashisiya lo77o ooso oothite. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Asa ubbaara saron daanaw hintew danda7etiya ubbaa oothite. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Ta ishato, hinte, hinte huuphen asas halo keyopite. Xoossay halo kessana mela iyaw aggaagite. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">“Taani halo kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:19">taani kushe zaarana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Zaare 32:35</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:19">yaagees Goday, geetetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Shin Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">“Ne morkey koshatiko muza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">I saamotiko ushsha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Neeni hessa oothiko iya huuphen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">yeella tama bonqo qolaasa”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Leemi 25:21</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:20">geetetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Iitaa lo77on xoonape attishin, iitan xoonetofa.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Deriya Ayseysatas Kiitetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Xoossaa shene gidonashin maati imetonna gishonne ha77i de7iya shuumatika Xoossaa shenen shuumetida gisho asi ubbay deriya ayseysatas kiitetanaw bessees. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Hessa gisho, maatara de7eysatas kiitetonna ixiya oonika Xoossaa kiitaa ixees. Kiitetonna ixiya oonika ba bolla pirdaa ehees. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Ayseysati iita ootheysatape attishin, lo77o ootheyisata yashshokona. Ayseysatas yayyonna agganaw koyay? Yaako lo77o ootha; enti nena galatana. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Enti new lo77oba oothanaw shuumetida Xoossaa aylle. Shin neeni iitabaa oothiko, enti iitabaa oothidaysa seeriya gisho iyaw yayya. Enti iita ootheyisata seeridi, Xoossaa hanquwa qoncisiya Xoossaa aylle. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossaa hanquwa xalaalas gidonashin, hinte kahay markatiya gisho deriya ayseysatas kiitetanaw bessees.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Hinte giira giireyka hessasa. Deriya ayseysati he oosuwa oothey, enti Xoossaa aylleta gidida gishosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Maato 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mar 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luqa 20:25</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Issuwas issuwas besseysa immite. Giira giiranaw besseysas giirite; qaraxa qanxanaw besseysas qaraxa qanxite; yayyanaw besseysas yayyite; bonchoy besseysa bonchite.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Issoy Issuwara Dosetite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Issoy issuwara siiqetite. Siiqo acope attishin, hinte bolla hara acoy doopo. Ase siiqiya oonika higgey geysa polis. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>“Laammofa; wodhopa; kaysotopa; amottofa” giya kiitaynne hara kiita ubbay, “Ase ne huupheda dosa” giya kiitan qashetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-17">Kessa 20:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Zaare 5:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Ase siiqiya oonika iya bolla iitabaa oothenna. Hessa gisho, ase siiqeysi higge kiitaa polis.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Dhiskofe hinte barkiya wodey ha77i gideysa akeekidi hessa oothite. Nu attana wodey koyro nu ammanida wodiyape ha77i nuuko matis. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Dhuma wodey aadhanaw hanees; wontay matis. Hiza, nuuni dhuma ooso aggidi poo7o ola miishe oykoos. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Ane gallas poo7on de7iya asada maaran de7oos. Mathoninne laymatethara gahetiya dumma dumma tuna oosotan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Laymatethara gahetiya dumma dumma tuna oosotan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woyko yethan, mathon, laymaton, qayxen gidopo gidi billanaw danda7etees. Laymatethara gahetiya dumma dumma tuna oosoti asi Xoossaa haarope kare keyidi do7a kando ekidi poliya ooso guussu.</char></note> palamaninne qanaaten gidopo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa kanduwa ma7ite; hinte nagarancho asatethay ba amuwa polana mela iyaw qopofite.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Asa Bolla Pirdofite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Ammanon daaburida oonaka shiishi ekitepe attishin, iya qofaa bolla pirdofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Qola 2:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Leemisos, ammanon minnida issi asi ay kathika maanaw danda7ees. Shin ammanon daaburiya asi atakilte xalaala mees. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Ubbabaa miya asi moonna uraa kadhopo. Ubbabaa moonna asi miya uraa bolla pirdofo. Xoossay ubbaa miya uraa shiishi ekis. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Hara asa aylle bolla pirdey neeni oonee? I daaburin woyko minnin ba Godaasa. Goday iya essanaw danda7iya gisho I minnidi eqana.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Qassi “Issi gallasay hara gallasape aadhees” yaagidi qopiya asi de7ees. Haray qassi, “Gallasati ubbay issi mela” gidi qopees. Shin issoy issoy ba qofaa akeekidi qacho. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Issi gallasaa hara gallasatape aathidi bonchiya oonika Godaa bonchoos gidi oothees. Ubba kathi miya asi Godaa bonchoos gidi mees. I miya he kathaa gisho, Xoossaa galatees. Ubba kathi moonna asi Godaa bonchoos moonna aggees; qassi moonna agon Xoosse galatees. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Nuupe oonika baw deenna; qassi nu giddofe oonika baw hayqenna. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Nu de7on de7iko Godaas de7oos; qassi hayqikoka Godaas hayqoos. Hiza, nu de7on de7in woyko hayqin Godaasa.<verse eid="ROM 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Kiristoosi hayqidi hayqope dendiday, de7on de7eysatasinne hayqidaysatas Godaa gidanaasa. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Yaatin, neeni ne ishaa bolla ayis pirday? Woyko neeni ne ishaa ayis kadhay? Nuuni ubbay Xoossaa pirda araata sinthan eqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Qoro 5:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan Goday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Taani de7on de7ayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">asa ubbay ta sinthan gulbatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">taani Xoossaa gideysa markatana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 14:11">yaagees. <verse eid="ROM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Hiza, nu oothidabaas nu huuphen huuphen Xoossaa sinthan shiiqidi zaaro immana.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara Asi Dhubethofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni issoy issuwa bolla pirdeysa aggoos. Shin hinte ishaa dhubisidi woyko qaxidi nagaran gelsiyaba oothonnaada naagetite. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Godaa Yesuusa ammaniya asada, ba huuphen tuna gidida kathi baynaysa taani geeshshada erayis. Shin issi asi issiba tuna gidi qopiko hessi iyaw tuna gidees. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Ne miya katha gisho ne ishaa dhubiyaba gidiko, Kiristoosan de7iya ne ishaa siiqaka. Kiristoosi iya gisho hayqida uraa ne miya kathan iya ayyaana de7uwa dhaysofa. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Hiza, hintew de7iya la77atetha harati borana mela oothopite. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Xoossaa kawotethay Geeshsha Ayyaanay immiya xillotethi, sarotethinne tuma ufaysife attishin, muussabaanne ushshaba gidenna. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Hessada Kiristoosas oothiya asi Xoossaa ufaysees; asanka anjetees.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Hessa gisho, ane nuuni sarotethi bentiya ogiyanne issuwa issuwa ammanon minthiya ogiya koyoos. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Katha gisho gada Xoossaa oosuwa dhaysofa. Ubba kathi meetetees, shin hara asi nagaran dhubisiya kathi muussi iita. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Ne ishay dhubetonna mela asho moonna woyko ushshu uyonna woyko ne ishaa dhubiya haraba oothonna agoy lo77o.<verse eid="ROM 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Hiza, ha ne ammanuwa ne giddoninne ne Xoossaa giddon naaga. Like gidi qopidaba oothiya wode iya kahay mootonna uray anjetidaysa. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Shin sidhishe miya uraas iya muussay ammanon gidonna gisho pirdetees. Ammanoy bayna oosetida ooso ubbay nagara.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Nuuni ammanon minnidaysati daaburanchota toohuwa tookanaw bessees. Nuuni nuna ufaysanaw bessenna. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Nuuni nu ishaa ammanon minthanaw iya maaddanawunne ufaysanaw bessees. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kiristoosi bana ufaysibeenna. Shin Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Asay nena cayida cashshay tana gakis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz 69:9</ref>.</char></note> geetetidi xaafetidaysada hanis. <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay immiya gencaninne minthethuwan nu ufaysaa ekana mela Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafetida ubbay nuna tamaarsanaw xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Gencanne minotethi immiya Goday hinte Kiristoos Yesuusa kaalliya wode issifetethi hintew immo. <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>Hessika, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa Aawa, Xoossaa, issi wozananinne issi qaalan hinte bonchana melasa.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wongeli Asa Ubbaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Kiristoosi hintena ekidaysada Xoossaa bonchoos issoy issuwa ekite. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Xoossay beni aawatas immida ufaysay poletana melanne iya tumatethay eretana mela Kiristoosi Ayhudeta aylle gididi yidaysa ta hintew odayis. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Kiristoosi Ayhudeta aylle gidida hara gaasoy qassi Ayhude gidonna asati Xoossaa iya maarotethaa gisho galatana melasa. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ta nena Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon galatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">ne sunthaa sabbana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Same 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Maz 18:49</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:9">geetetidi xaafetidaysada hanis.<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Qassi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Ayhude gidonna asato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Xoossaa deriyara ufaytite”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Zaare 32:43</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:10">yaagetis.<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Qassi zaaridi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Ayhude gidonna asato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Godaa galatite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">kawotetha ubbay iya sabbite”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Maz 117:1</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:11">yaagetis.<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Hessada Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Isseye kochaafe yeletiya issoy yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">I kawotetha ubbaa haarana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Enti banta ufaysaa iya bolla wothana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11:10</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:12">yaagees.<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqan hinte diccana mela ufaysi immiya Xoossay, hinte ammanuwa gaason hintew ufaysinne sarotethi kumethi immo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Kiita Xaafida Gaaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ta ishato, hintenan lo77otethinne eratethi kumidaysa qassi issoy issuwa zoranaw danda7eysa ta geeshshada erayis. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Taani hintena issi issiba guja akeekisanaw koyada yayyonna ha dabdaabiya hintew xaafas. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Taani Kiristoos Yesuusa aylle gidada, Ayhude gidonna asaas kahineda oothada, Wongela odana mela Xoossay taw aadho keehatetha immis. Ayhude gidonna asay Geeshsha Ayyaanan geeyidi, Xoossaa ufaysiya yarsho gidana mela Xoossay hessa oothis.<verse eid="ROM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Taani Kiristoos Yesuusan gidada Xoossaas oothiya oosuwan ceeqetayis. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ayhude gidonna asay Xoossaas kiitetanaada, Kiristoosi ta qaalanne ta oosuwa baggara oothida oosuwape attishin, hari ta ceeqetiyabay baawa. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Xoossay hessa malaataninne Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqan waati oothidaako ta hintew odana. Taani Yerusalaamepe doomada, Iliwarqoone gakanaw Kiristoosa Wongela sabbakas. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Taani hara asi baasida bessan keexanaw koyke. Kiristoosa sunthay xeegetiboona bessan Wongela odanaw amottayis. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Iyabay odetiboonna asati iya be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">iyabaa si7iboona asati akeekana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa 52:15</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:21">geetetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Hessa gaason, taani hinteko yaanaw danda7abike.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Roome 1:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Shin taani ha77i ha heeran ta oosuwa ongida gishonne daro laythafe doomada hintena be7anaw laamotida gisho, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>taani Ispeene bashe hintena be7anaw qopas. Qassi guutha wode hintera ufaytidaape guye, Ispeene biya wode hinte ta ogiyas tana maaddana mela koyayis.<verse eid="ROM 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Shin ha77i taani Xoossaa asata maaddanaw Yerusalaame bayis. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Maqedoonenne Akayan de7iya Xoossa asati, Yerusalaamen de7iya manqota miishen maaddanaw koyida gishosa. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Enti manqota maaddanaysi entaw attonnaba gidida gisho banta huuphen hessa oothanaw qofa qachidosona. Ayhudeti Ayhude gidonaysatara ayyaana anjuwa shaaketiko, enti qassi bantaw de7iyaban Ayhudeta maaddanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:11">2 Qoro 9:11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Hessa gisho, taani he shiiqida miishiya entaw immidaape guye, Ispeene bashe hinte matara aadhana. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Taani hinteko biya wode Kiristoosa anjuwan kumada baanaysa erayis.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ta ishato, taw Xoossaa woossishe ta baaxiyan taara eqana mela Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosaninne Geeshsha Ayyaana siiquwan hintena woossayis. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Xoossay tana Yihudan de7iya ammanonna asatape ashshanaadanne Yerusalaamen ta oothana oosoy Xoossaa asata matan eketana mela taw woossite. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Qassi Xoossay giiko, taani hinteko bada ufaysan hintera shempana mela taw woossite. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Sarotethaa Xoossay hinte ubbaara gido. Amin7i.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kinkire kataman de7iya woosa keethan oothiya nu michiya Feebena lo77o maccas gideysa hinte erana mela koyayis. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Hinte ammaniya asati Godaa sunthan mokanaw bessiya ammaniya asatape issuwada iyo mokite. Iya hintefe koyaba ubbaa iyo maaddite. Iya ba huuphen daro asaa maaddasu; qassi tana ta huuphenka daro maaddasu.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Kiristoos Yesuusa oosuwa taara issife oothiya Phirisqillanne Aqila saro giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Hawa 18:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Enti ta gisho banta shempuwa aathidi immidosona. Ta xalaala gidonashin, Ayhude gidonna asaa woosa keetha ubbay enta galatees. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Enta son shiiqiya ammaniya asaa saro giite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Iise biittan Kiristoosa koyro ammanida, ta dosiya Ephanexoosas ta sarothuwa odite.<verse eid="ROM 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Hinte gisho ooson daro daaburida Mayraamo saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Taara qasho keethan aathida ta Ayhude laggeta Andiraniqosanne Yuniyasa saro giite. Enti Yesuusa hawaareta giddon eretidaysata. Qassi enti Kiristoosa taape sinthe ammanidosona.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Godan ammaniya ta siiqo laggiya, Philiyaxoona saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Kiristoosa oosuwa nuura issife oothiya Urbaanosanne ta dosiya Istakuusa saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Kiristoosan ammanthiya aylliya Aphelisas ta sarothuwa odite. Arsxobuloosa soo asaas ta sarothuwa odite. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ta Ayhude laggiya Herodiyoona saro giite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Narsisasinne iya soo asaape Kiristoosa ammanidaysata saro giite.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Godaa oosuwan daaburiya Tirufaynanne Tirufoosa saro giite. Qassi Godaas daro daaburada oothiya, ta dosiya Xarsido saro giite. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Godaa oosuwan daro eretida Rufoosasinne tana ba na7ada be7iya iya aayes ta sarothuwa odite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar 15:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asqarixoonas, Afilesonphas, Hermeesas, Phaxrobaanas, Hermaasinne entara de7iya ammaniya ishata ubbaas ta sarothuwa odite. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Filologuusa, Yuula, Neera, iya michiw, Alinxoosanne entara de7iya ammaniya asa ubbaa saro giite.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Geeshsha yeeretethi yeeretishe, issoy issuwa sarothite. Kiristoosa woosa keetha ubbay hintena saro yaagosona.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wursetha Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ta ishato, hinte tamaarida timirtiya ixidi, hinte giddon shaaketethinne meto medhiya asatape naagetite. Entafe haakite. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Hessa mela asati bantaw oothosonape attishin, nu Godaa Kiristoosas oothokona. Banta mal7iya doonaninne saphothiya qaalan ayko eronna asaa wozanaa balethoosona. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Wongelas hinte kiitetidaysa asa ubbay si7idaysi tana ufaysees. Shin hinte lo77oba erana melanne iitabaape haakana mela ta koyayis. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Sarotethaa Xoossay Xalahiya hinte tohuwape garsan gaaci yeggana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatethay hintera gido.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Taara oothiya Ximotiyoosi hintena saro yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Hawa 16:1</ref>.</char></note> Hessadaka, ta dabboti Luqiyoosi, Yaasoninne Sosiphaxroosi hintena saro yaagosona.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Taani, ha dabdaabiya xaafida, Xarxiyoosi, hintena Godaa sunthan saro yaagayis.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Tana mokidaynne woosa keetha ubbay iya son shiiqiya Gaayoosi, hintena saro yaagees. Katamaa miishiya oykiya Erasxoosinne nu ishaa Qarxoosi hintena saro yaagosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Hawa 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:14">2 Qoro 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Ximo 4:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>[Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatethay hinte ubbaara gido. Amin7i.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beni koyro maxaafatan paydo 24 deenna.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Hawa 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:14">2 Qoro 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Ximo 4:20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Galatay Xoossaas gido. Taani, Yesuus Kiristoosaba odiya Wongela qaalanne daro wodepe qosetidi gam7ida tumatethan, Xoossay hintena ammanon minthidi essanaw danda7ees. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Shin ha77i he tumay qoncis. Kawotetha ubbay ammanidi kiitetana mela merinaa Xoossaa kiitan nabeti he tumabaa xaafidosona.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara cincatethi iya xalaalas de7iya, issi Xoossaas merinaw bonchoy gido. Amin7i.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
